   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Example 3: every label in the network",
   "originalText": "Example 3: every label in the network",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b18-text-5",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 516,
   "width": 547,
   "height": 60,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 39595,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 523645,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Mono numbers next to each router: its Prefix-SID label. Under\nthe B–C link: B’s Adj-SID for B→C (24005) and C’s for C→B\n(24006), both set in the file.",
   "originalText": "Mono numbers next to each router: its Prefix-SID label. Under\nthe B–C link: B’s Adj-SID for B→C (24005) and C’s for C→B\n(24006), both set in the file.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b18-text-6",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 586,
   "width": 446,
   "height": 123,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 47514,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 628374,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Router  Index  Prefix   Adj-SIDs (auto unless \"file\")\n------  -----  -------  ----------------------------\nS       1      16001    →A 24000   →E 24001\nE       2      16002    →C 24000   →S 24001\nA       3      16003    →B 24000   →S 24001\nB       4      16004    →A 24000   →C 24005 file\nC       5      16005    →B 24006 file   →E 24000",
   "originalText": "Router  Index  Prefix   Adj-SIDs (auto unless \"file\")\n------  -----  -------  ----------------------------\nS       1      16001    →A 24000   →E 24001\nE       2      16002    →C 24000   →S 24001\nA       3      16003    →B 24000   →S 24001\nB       4      16004    →A 24000   →C 24005 file\nC       5      16005    →B 24006 file   →E 24000",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b18-text-7",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 719,
   "width": 556,
   "height": 40,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 55433,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 733103,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "S → E repair: PrefixSID(B), AdjSID(B→C), PrefixSID(E) = 16004,\n24005, 16002 (B17).",
   "originalText": "S → E repair: PrefixSID(B), AdjSID(B→C), PrefixSID(E) = 16004,\n24005, 16002 (B17).",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b18-rectangle-8",
