   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "b18-text-9",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 128,
   "width": 666,
   "height": 28,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 71271,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 942561,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The rule: two kinds of label, two ways to get a number",
   "originalText": "The rule: two kinds of label, two ways to get a number",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b18-text-10",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 166,
   "width": 692,
   "height": 140,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 79190,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1047290,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Prefix-SID label  =  SRGB base + SID index        (one SRGB for all, D9)\n                    16000     + 4  =  16004      (router B)\n\nAdj-SID label     =  value from the file  (adj_sid_ab / adj_sid_ba)\n                     else auto: each router counts from 24000,\n                     neighbors in ID order, then link-ID order,\n                     skipping labels it already uses",
   "originalText": "Prefix-SID label  =  SRGB base + SID index        (one SRGB for all, D9)\n                    16000     + 4  =  16004      (router B)\n\nAdj-SID label     =  value from the file  (adj_sid_ab / adj_sid_ba)\n                     else auto: each router counts from 24000,\n                     neighbors in ID order, then link-ID order,\n                     skipping labels it already uses",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b18-text-11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 316,
   "width": 962,
   "height": 107,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 87109,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1152019,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  A Prefix-SID means \"go to router B on the shortest path\". Every router has the same SRGB, so 16004\n   means B everywhere (RFC 8402 §3.2).\n•  An Adj-SID means \"send it out of this one link\". It is local: only the router that owns the link\n   reads it (RFC 8402 §3.4).\n•  Auto Adj-SIDs start at 24000, just above the SRGB range 16000–23999.",
   "originalText": "•  A Prefix-SID means \"go to router B on the shortest path\". Every router has the same SRGB, so 16004\n   means B everywhere (RFC 8402 §3.2).\n•  An Adj-SID means \"send it out of this one link\". It is local: only the router that owns the link\n   reads it (RFC 8402 §3.4).\n•  Auto Adj-SIDs start at 24000, just above the SRGB range 16000–23999.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b18-text-12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 433,
   "width": 564,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 95028,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1256748,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Auto-numbering on Example 4 (no Adj-SIDs in the file)",
   "originalText": "Auto-numbering on Example 4 (no Adj-SIDs in the file)",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b18-text-13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 467,
   "width": 567,
   "height": 94,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 102947,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1361477,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Router  Neighbors in ID order    Adj-SIDs\n------  -----------------------  ------------------------------\nPE1     P1, P2                   24000, 24001\nP2      P1, P4, PE1              24000, 24001, 24002\nP4      P1, P2, P3, PE2          24000, 24001, 24002, 24003",
   "originalText": "Router  Neighbors in ID order    Adj-SIDs\n------  -----------------------  ------------------------------\nPE1     P1, P2                   24000, 24001\nP2      P1, P4, PE1              24000, 24001, 24002\nP4      P1, P2, P3, PE2          24000, 24001, 24002, 24003",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b18-text-14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 571,
   "width": 959,
   "height": 40,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 110866,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1466206,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "ID order is character order: \"P4\" comes before \"PE1\" because 4 sorts before E. Used in repairs: PE1 → P1 is\nAdjSID(P2→P1), PrefixSID(P1) = 24000, 16001; PE2 → P3 is 24002, 16003.",
   "originalText": "ID order is character order: \"P4\" comes before \"PE1\" because 4 sorts before E. Used in repairs: PE1 → P1 is\nAdjSID(P2→P1), PrefixSID(P1) = 24000, 16001; PE2 → P3 is 24002, 16003.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b18-text-15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 621,
   "width": 543,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 118785,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1570935,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Set in the file (examples/03-ring5-highmetric.yaml)",
   "originalText": "Set in the file (examples/03-ring5-highmetric.yaml)",
