   "text": "- { a: C, b: B, metric: 10, adj_sid_ab: 24006, adj_sid_ba: 24005 }\n\nadj_sid_ab is for a→b = C→B  →  24006 (C’s label)\nadj_sid_ba is for b→a = B→C  →  24005 (B’s label)",
   "originalText": "- { a: C, b: B, metric: 10, adj_sid_ab: 24006, adj_sid_ba: 24005 }\n\nadj_sid_ab is for a→b = C→B  →  24006 (C’s label)\nadj_sid_ba is for b→a = B→C  →  24005 (B’s label)",
