   "text": "In Example 4, P2→P1 is 24000 and\nP1→P2 is 24000 too. That is fine:\neach router only reads its own\nAdj-SIDs, so the same number means a\ndifferent link on each router.",
   "originalText": "In Example 4, P2→P1 is 24000 and\nP1→P2 is 24000 too. That is fine:\neach router only reads its own\nAdj-SIDs, so the same number means a\ndifferent link on each router.",
